<title>EGYPT: Egypt selling 10,000 minutes on satellite channel.</title>
<headline>Egypt selling 10,000 minutes on satellite channel.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Radio and Television Union said on Monday it wanted to sell 10,000 minutes a year of advertising time on its satellite television channel.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is noon (1000 GMT) on November 12 and the Union will take a decision the next day, it said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
